The current leading architecture nests:

```text
inner superconnection curvature Phi=Q^2
  -> scalar cost V=1/2||Phi||^2
  -> outer Witten differential on admissible configuration space.
```

The inner layer carries bundle/gauge/phase structure. The outer layer carries
